{
  "id": "HOS.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 9",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rejoice not, O Israel, for joy, like the peoples; for thou hast played the harlot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " from thy God; thou hast loved hire upon every grain-floor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The threshing-floor and the winepress shall not feed them, and the new wine shall fail her. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not dwell in Jehovah’s land; but Ephraim shall return to Egypt, and they shall eat unclean food in Assyria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not pour out wine-",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to Jehovah, neither shall they be pleasing unto him: their sacrifices shall be unto them as the bread of mourners; all that eat thereof shall be polluted; for their bread shall be for their appetite; it shall not come into the house of Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What will ye do in the day of solemn assembly, and in the day of the feast of Jehovah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they are gone away from destruction; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Egypt shall gather them up, Memphis shall bury them; their pleasant things of silver, nettles shall possess them; thorns shall be in their tents. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The days of visitation are come, the days of recompense are come; Israel shall know it: the prophet is a fool, the man that hath the spirit is mad, for the abundance of thine iniquity, and because the enmity is great. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a watchman with my God: as for the prophet, a fowler’s snare is in all his ways, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " enmity in the house of his God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have deeply corrupted themselves, as in the days of Gibeah: he will remember their iniquity, he will visit their sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I found Israel like grapes in the wilderness; I saw your fathers as the first-ripe in the fig-tree at its first season: but they came to Baal-peor, and consecrated themselves unto the shameful thing, and became abominable like that which they loved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for Ephraim, their glory shall fly away like a bird: there shall be no birth, and none with child, and no conception. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though they bring up their children, yet will I bereave them, so that not a man shall be left: yea, woe also to them when I depart from them! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim, like as I have seen Tyre, is planted in a pleasant place: but Ephraim shall bring out his children to the slayer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give them, O Jehovah—what wilt thou give? give them a miscarrying womb and dry breasts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All their wickedness is in Gilgal; for there I hated them: because of the wickedness of their doings I will drive them out of my house; I will love them no more; all their princes are revolters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim is smitten, their root is dried up, they shall bear no fruit: yea, though they bring forth, yet will I slay the beloved fruit of their womb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My God will cast them away, because they did not hearken unto him; and they shall be wanderers among the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "HOS.10",
    "number": "10",
    "bookId": "HOS"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "HOS.8",
